{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1449213-the-ascendance-of-the-talents","id":1449213,"title":"The Ascendance of the Talents?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-21T15:22:10-07:00","id":1449213,"title":"The Ascendance of the Talents?","content":"So Aberrant is the age of Nova and Quantum Ascension and Aeon is the Age of Psion and Psi Ascension but despite the fact that we have Talents in the core Trinity book and the up coming Assassin we really don\u2019t have a Talent Ascension setting. We know that most races either Ascend using either Quantum or Psi, some races choose between some don\u2019t have a choice, but Humanity according to the settings have a third option and that\u2019s Flux of which the Talents are the very beginning of. What I\u2019m getting at is I think Onyx Path should do another core setting this one far into the future possibly a Space based one where we see the Talents starting to show signs of their possibilities. Thru out Aeon and Aberrant Talents are basically considered normal people showing no sign of their potential. We know at least in a vague way that Mercer is just as powerful as Mail or Bhurano but talents so none of the potential of Novas or Psion. What does everyone else think do we need another setting that shows this potential and what would we call it the name would have to start with a \u201cA\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6379-tytalan","name":"tytalan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-21T15:47:14-07:00","id":1449215,"title":"","content":"Oh, there's definitely an appetite for it. The upcoming TC: Adventure! book even suggests the possibility of an alternate timeline where Novas and Psions never become a thing, and Talents eventually develop conscious control over their timeline-altering powers. Ian Watson hasn't said that they <i>won't</i> do it; but he's cautioned against holding your breath.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-21T16:32:39-07:00","id":1449218,"title":"","content":"In Media Res they pointed that there is a reality that a nation took control of the planet and after that start conquering parallel realities, and also there are wondrous items that require inspiration to activate and may take the characters to other realities or to the space between, that sounds a lot like Powered talent tech.<br /> <br /> Well, I am just pointing what we have, not much what we can do using the books because we don\u2019t have anything official in terms of what can be done by characters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-22T00:32:50-07:00","id":1449230,"title":"","content":"As a personal opinion, it may not be possible for a setting to have multiple ascension-level Talents in it. Novas control the physical forces of the universe, Psions/Psiads control the informational content of the universe that provides it with meaning, and Talents control narrative reality- basically, they control the Plot. <br /> <br /> If high-level Talents conflict, they're probably going to eventually all get what they want- to live in a universe where the Plot went as desired- perhaps one where their opponents simply never were Inspired, merely skilled competitors or antagonists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26448-shalmaneser","name":"Shalmaneser","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-22T04:39:55-07:00","id":1449237,"title":"","content":"Well, if you do the same with 2 or 3 Q9 Novas, the entire Star system is their playground, having more than one of them in the star system would be granted destruction of everything there, as they fight to make it their own way.<br /> <br /> Psi is probably the way to a peaceful transcendence of the entire civilization and while the others are about individuals, even if they can do a lot fir the society.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-22T05:02:13-07:00","id":1449238,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1449213-the-ascendance-of-the-talents?p=1449237#post1449237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Psi is probably the way to a peaceful transcendence of the entire civilization and while the others are about individuals, even if they can do a lot fir the society.</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering that Talents do what they do consciously and subconsciously, it's probable that the entire Trinity Continuum main &quot;timeline&quot; is simply Max Mercer's idea of what an interesting, challenging, engaging universe is. He wrote the plot he gets to live in, tragedies and all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26448-shalmaneser","name":"Shalmaneser","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-22T07:00:54-07:00","id":1449244,"title":"","content":"If you read Adventure! secrets chapter you will notice it\u2019s not. The way his powers work he can do stuff but can\u2019t try again, the best he can do is try to fix it latter off prevent the situation to happen, but not relive a situation.<br /> <br /> But his powers works around time and not probability or plot manipulation, so...<br /> <br /> Also, talents powers works on a short time prediction range, it means they can\u2019t use it as is to analyze what is the best result at a far future, they can only use to change to what seams better at the moment. You may need a guy capable of seeing the long range future and a guy to manipulating it at short range all the time (that can be the same guy).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 05-22-2021, 10:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-22T21:21:36-07:00","id":1449314,"title":"","content":"Obviously the situation for Talents is they hit a point where they gain maximum focus by the plot and thus have always been something more important. You have a bunch of time traveling do gooders and baders andd suddenly one of them happens to be one of the Founding members of the civllization.. and the super secret one. And then later they are &quot;The last of their kind&quot; because that's more interesting but we all know eventually its even more interesting to have a mirror image and suddenly there's more Talents again... and they they cycle back to being the first and source the Timeless child...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-22T21:51:41-07:00","id":1449317,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1449213-the-ascendance-of-the-talents?p=1449314#post1449314\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Obviously the situation for Talents is they hit a point where they gain maximum focus by the plot and thus have always been something more important. You have a bunch of time traveling do gooders and baders andd suddenly one of them happens to be one of the Founding members of the civllization.. and the super secret one. And then later they are &quot;The last of their kind&quot; because that's more interesting but we all know eventually its even more interesting to have a mirror image and suddenly there's more Talents again... and they they cycle back to being the first and source the Timeless child...</div> </div> </div> </div>Like when the one Talented guy- at the very peak of power- in the universe somehow finds it dull, and needs a more enlivening universe to adventure in. So when he goes to visit a friend who is doing this &quot;Unlimited Energy&quot; experiment, he- consciously or unconsciously- makes sure the world becomes much more interesting afterward.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26448-shalmaneser","name":"Shalmaneser","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-22T22:08:24-07:00","id":1449318,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1449213-the-ascendance-of-the-talents?p=1449244#post1449244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But his powers works around time and not probability or plot manipulation, so...<br /> <br /> Also, talents powers works on a short time prediction range, it means they can\u2019t use it as is to analyze what is the best result at a far future, they can only use to change to what seams better at the moment. You may need a guy capable of seeing the long range future and a guy to manipulating it at short range all the time (that can be the same guy).</div> </div> </div> </div>It's the particular effect of Dramatic Editing that affects the Plot, and that doesn't really have time limits. Picture a Talent trapped in an underground tomb, with no escape or way out. And then, after a few spent Inspiration, he finds a tool left by the builders of the tomb thousands of years ago that permits him to dig his way to safety. Mercer's version is arguably an extension of seeing and manipulating the Plot- when moving in time, he's simply skipping ahead or back a few pages to look at the ongoing Plot, or, when stuck in other universes, jumping to another narrative entirely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26448-shalmaneser","name":"Shalmaneser","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-23T08:33:12-07:00","id":1449351,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1449213-the-ascendance-of-the-talents?p=1449218#post1449218\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In Media Res they pointed that there is a reality that a nation took control of the planet and after that start conquering parallel realities, and also there are wondrous items that require inspiration to activate and may take the characters to other realities or to the space between, that sounds a lot like Powered talent tech.<br /> <br /> Well, I am just pointing what we have, not much what we can do using the books because we don\u2019t have anything official in terms of what can be done by characters.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes, the &quot;Terran Multiplicity.&quot; A delightfully menacing foe with great potential. <br /> <br /> For my druthers (and the direction I would go in a setting), would be that expanded Talent powers would mostly be in the form of more powerful Weird Science. Flux based technology of ever increasing power can make &quot;Cross-Time&quot; travel possible. And makes for some great story potential. Probability manipulation and time distortion could open up FTL travel, and all manner of weirdness, while keeping adventurers relatively &quot;human&quot; in scope.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-05T17:57:39-07:00","id":1451088,"title":"","content":"Mercer hasn\u2019t chosen the time line it\u2019s more he\u2019s seen the time line and is attempting to change things by changing what currently happening. Also I\u2019m not talking actual ascending talents so much as a setting in the current universe were talents are the raising power like Novas are in aberrant or Psion are in Aeon. Right now talents are weak at best and I just picturing a new setting in the core time lines future where talents finally come into their own. There obviously a path for talents to ascend just like the Novas and the Psion ascend. I don\u2019t know how many of you\u2019ve actually played a talent based game but dramatic editing isn\u2019t as powerful or cut and dry like some have made it sound. I think Myth has some good ideas. Picture a spaceship drive not based on teleportation but instead on faster than light Flux drive. <br /> <br /> if the timeline progresses as it\u2019s be out line at some point the people will turn on the Orders and once that happens much of the high technology that is based on psionic\u2019s will break down just like a lot of the Nova tech did. Presumably this will happen after the main threats are defeated fought back. I see a setting were man has a actual interstellar presents not just 10 or so colony\u2019s but over a hundred breaking the mold of the other races who ascended after just a few colony\u2019s. By rejecting the collective ascension that Psi promised and the individual ascension that Quantum offered humanity has created a true galactic community. This would also mean that the races that mankind has encountered would not have gone the paths that the ones before did. In this time talents would come into their own more than likely with power level similar to the Psions that came before. I think this would be the appropriate final setting for the core timeline.<br /> <br /> also I don\u2019t see a ascended Talent as controlling the timeline but instead traveling the possibilities remember a talent doesn\u2019t so much control time as instead reaches into the multiverse to a timeline that has what they want. Remember Mercer stepped back from directly influencing Current events because his actions are making things worse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6379-tytalan","name":"tytalan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}